Most salespeople waste weeks on leads that were never going to buy. Three questions in the first three minutes tells you if this is worth your time. What are they using now? What's broken about it? What does it cost them if it stays broken? If they can't answer the third one, there's no urgency. Move on. Qualifying isn't about being difficult. It's about being efficient with your time and theirs.

